<div class=\"window-refusal\" role=\"alert\">
  <h1>Window below the minimum size</h1>
  <p>The editor chrome refuses below its minimum window size rather than rendering an unusable layout.</p>
  <p>Minimum: <code>900×600</code> · refusal <code>DESKTOP_WINDOW_BELOW_MINIMUM</code></p>
</div>
<div class=\"shell\" data-mode=\"build\" data-profile=\"game\" data-assistant=\"open\" data-assistant-mode=\"build\" data-assistant-route=\"byo\" data-assistant-runtime=\"none\" data-assistant-runtime-event=\"sceneaxi:desktop-assistant-runtime\" data-assistant-busy=\"false\" data-overlay=\"none\" data-tier=\"regular\" data-details-open=\"false\" data-drawer-left=\"closed\" data-drawer-inspector=\"closed\" data-drawer-assistant=\"closed\">

<header class=\"title-bar\">
  <div class=\"window-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
